OL,3,ACleveland police chief proud of force
OL,4,Abut being 'let down' by funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police's Chief Constable has
OL,7,Fsaid she is proud of her "brave" force
OL,8,Fbut that it was being "let down" by the
OL,9,Fway it was funded, following a fatal
OL,10,Fcrash which killed seven people
OL,11,Fincluding two police officers.
OL,13,FIn her first sit-down interview since
OL,14,Fthe A66 crash, speaking exclusively to
OL,15,Fthe BBC, Victoria Fuller said the force
OL,16,Fneeded to become part of a larger force
OL,17,Fwith greater resources.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
