OL,3,ATrump's peace envoys to visit Moscow
OL,4,Aand Kyiv over weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS negotiators Steve Witkoff and Jared
OL,7,FKushner will visit Russia and Ukraine
OL,8,Fthis weekend, as efforts to end the war
OL,9,Fbetween the two nations appear to be
OL,10,Fgathering pace.
OL,12,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,13,Fconfirmed he will meet the envoys on
OL,14,FSunday after they visit Moscow on
OL,15,FSaturday to hold talks with Russian
OL,16,FPresident Vladimir Putin.
OL,18,FWitkoff and Kushner have led US
OL,19,FPresident Donald Trump's efforts to
OL,20,Fbroker a peace deal, but a gulf remains
OL,21,Fbetween the two warring sides.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
