OL,3,ATrump's peace envoys to visit Moscow
OL,4,Aand Kyiv over weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They are bringing with them a proposal
OL,7,Fto end the war," Trump told reporters
OL,8,Fwhen asked about the visits.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
